    "publication_date": "2020-06-29",
    "description": "<p>These datasets were obtained by an X-band phased array weather radar operated by Japan Radio Co., Ltd. during a period from 0759 to 0810 local standard time&nbsp;on October 12, 2019. The data type is NetCDF and&nbsp;variables are radar reflectivity and Doppler velocity in spherical coordinates.</p>",
